<span id="A9.T18.6.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Stranger Things is set in the 1980s, primarily in the fictional town of Hawkins, Indiana.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A9.T18.6.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A9.T18.6.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:3pt;padding-bottom:3pt;">Thought 2</td>
<td id="A9.T18.6.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:3pt;padding-bottom:3pt;">
<span id="A9.T18.6.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A9.T18.6.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">The observation says that it is set in a "fictional town of Hawkins", so it is not set in Bloomington.</span>
</span></td></tr>
